                     As of <t:date>2011</t:date>, monastic community has, reportedly, up to 50 monks.
                        Below, at the foot of the mount, there is a small church at the place where <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10581Zamika">
                        <t:roleName type="title">ʾabuna</t:roleName> (Za-Mikāʾel) ʾAragāwi</t:persName>, reportedly "disappeared" (therefore called Mǝswārom).
                     A small nunnery is located in the village nearby.



